    "title": "Full Stack Development Project for an AI Powered Marketing Platform",
    "ciphertext": "~022079258892398557006",
    "description": "We're hiring for a Full-Stack Engineer at Avicen.\nWe're looking for a full-stack engineer to build our AI Agent — powered by Claude — from a documented spec to a production, multi-tenant SaaS product.\nYou'd own the full stack: the Next.js composer, the AI media pipeline (fal.ai, render, transcription), background jobs, Ayrshare publishing, Stripe billing, and the infrastructure underneath.\nThe stack is TypeScript-first — Next.js 15, Trigger.dev, Supabase — with Python/FastAPI for existing services, Claude for the agent, and fal.ai as the model gateway.\nWho we are looking for: someone strong across React/Next.js and async backend work, comfortable with Postgres, background jobs, and third-party API integration, who has shipped and operated real software in production.\nExperience with LLM integration, generative media APIs, Stripe billing, or HIPAA-aware architecture is a plus — not a requirement.\n\n📍 Remote (US) · Part-time to start, moving toward contract-to-hire.\n📩 If this sounds like you — or someone you know — email me with your résumé and one thing you've shipped from zero to production.",
